Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres
Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Palette $000,$FFF,$F00,$0F0,$00F,$FF0,$0FF,$F0F
For I=0 To 15 : Ink I : Bar I*20,0 To I*20+19,39 : Next I
Ink 1 : Text 10,30,"BLOCK"
Get Block 1,0,0,64,40
Get Cblock 2,32,0,64,40
Put Block 1,0,60 : Put Block 1,100,60,1 : Put Block 1,200,60,0,1
Put Cblock 2,0,110
Get Block 3,0,0,64,40,1 : Ink 0 : Bar 0,150 To 319,199 : Put Block 3,10,150
Hrev Block 1 : Put Block 1,100,150 : Vrev Block 1 : Put Block 1,200,150
Del Block 1 : Del Cblock 2
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/blocks_1.iff"
